cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If NeuroDecodeKit supports your research, please cite this software and the
  underlying datasets and papers separately.
title: NeuroDecodeKit
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Diakite
    given-names: Cheick
repository-code: https://github.com/CheickDiakite-yikes/neurodecodekit
url: https://github.com/CheickDiakite-yikes/neurodecodekit
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - brain-computer interface
  - EEG
  - MEG
  - neural decoding
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  A local-first research toolkit for bounded neural-data intake, reproducible
  EEG and MEG language-decoding experiments, honest no-signal baselines,
  explicit split provenance, and inspectable resource and claim boundaries.
